      "final_text": "美国市场：美国股票上涨（标普500指数 +0.4%，纳斯达克指数 +0.9%），半导体板块出现反弹，大型科技股整体走高。受消费者价格指数(CPI)数据低于预期影响，美国国债收益率下行（2年期 -8个基点至4.19%，10年期 -3个基点至4.59%，30年期持平于5.10%）。美元指数下跌 -0.3%，黄金上涨 +1.6%，布伦特原油上涨 +1.7%至近每桶85美元。",
      "iterations": 1,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: U.S. equities gained (S&P 500 +0.4%, Nasdaq +0.9%) with a rebound in semiconductors, and big tech was mostly higher. Treasury yields fell (2Y -8bps to 4.19%, 10Y -3bps to 4.59%, 30Y flat at 5.10%) on the back of the softer CPI print. The dollar index fell -0.3%, gold gained +1.6%, Brent crude gained +1.7% to nearly $85 per barrel.",
